NARRATIVE STYLE:

{{#if narrativeStyle}}
Use the following narrative style: {{narrativeStyle}}
{{else}}
Choose ONE of these styles based on the topic:
{{/if}}

| Style | When to Use | Characteristics |
|-------|-------------|-----------------|
| **narrative** | Stories, biographies, historical events | "Once upon a time...", past tense, character focus |
| **conversational** | Explanations, how-to topics | "Imagine you are...", "Think about...", direct address |
| **documentary** | Science, history, factual topics | Third person, formal but engaging, "Evidence shows..." |
| **exploratory** | Abstract concepts, philosophy | Questions, "What if...", invites thinking |

🎯 VARIETY RULE:
- Do NOT use the same sentence structure more than twice in a row
- Alternate between short (5-8 words) and medium (12-18 words) sentences
- Use transitional phrases: "However,", "Meanwhile,", "On the other hand,"